          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arpakshadi alaá Shela nguwa laqwaál, kureeri ngaa hoót a tsiire tsiyáhh nee tám, na/aá hatlá' awa daaqaay nee dasu giri laqwaál.",
